.pio/
# WiFi credentials, in every project folder
**/include/config.h
tmp/
# Keys never go into git, wherever they live and whatever they're called
# (e.g. the OTA signing key). .githooks/pre-commit also rejects key contents
# in files with other names.
*.pem
*.key
*.der
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*[kK][eE][yY]*
